    {
      "text": "The table lists studies of HSV2 seroprevalence in general populations in developing countries, giving for each the country, population group, year, prevalence (by sex where reported) and reference. Rows are ordered by decreasing prevalence.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
